 "words": {
  "rule": "Streets with regulatory street sweeping signs are swept on the same day each month, like the second Tuesday: no parking during the hours on the sign.",
  "afterpass": "All year. $60 ticket, and the car can be towed. No sweeping on City holidays, and a missed signed sweep is not made up.",
  "dataNotes": "Dates from the City's 2026 Street Sweeping Schedule (one row per address and date), only where the City marks enforcement signs, each address placed on its block and side by the City's centerline address ranges. The City publishes no hours: 8 AM to 2 PM is read from its street cleaning tickets, so the sign's hours win. City holidays are taken off the dates. Streets with advisory signs or none are left off: no ticket there."
